    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati ghoah sugoocheanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goombaliischeewa hoorgeadaanyi Yehoshafateeda was orjeedaanyi, ak gwasissa geaw uurda jea gang'uchi Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwayiin shirikarajeega jeeda mujiinajeega sineaweesa hilooga bea Yuda, aba ng'ata ghwayiin furiischoodiga jeeda ng'eanyiida Yuda ea jeeda mujiinajeega Efraimu was gea ghayi geanda ghweandaanyi was Asa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea NG'UTAMIIDA gwandeayi sea Yehoshafati, aba gideaba gabadiina naweadinga ghayi bea mwadi bea ghwaan, nea ea miighanyi ghwaat geeshta Baali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niny ghwaat geeshta ASEETA was ghwaan, nea gawadiina jeeda diigheanyeekaaschi, nea ea mawuurji gidabadiiniida fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoahang'waayi NG'UTAMIIDA gheambalmeeda aba geatingaaschi, aba ng'ata gweadu gujaweeda fuga sean bea Yuda heeda Yehoshafati; hean gabaruur nea gaba mureeda haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geegatkat gurooroadaanyi ghwaat naweeda NG'UTAMIIDA; aba ng'ata geang'aamwa heetiyeada ea Asherimu jeeda ng'eanyiida Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda gweaydeaba samwagu bea gheambalmeadaanyi hean goojeakta fugaaschi hees siguura Ben-haili, ea Obadiya, ea Sakariya, ea Netaneli, ea Mikaya, gaweay goonealshi aba jeeda mujiinajeega Yuda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea goodeayi fuga Lawi, siguura Shemaya, ea Netaniya, ea Sebadiya, ea Asaheli, ea Shemiramoti, ea Yehonadani, ea Adoniya, ea Dobiya, ea Dobadoniya; sea ashoohoodiga siguura Elishama ea Yehoramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goonealshi aba Yuda, nea gwandeawa gitaabooda digheanyeeka bea NG'UTAMIIDA; hean gwaneaweesa mujiinajeega sean bea Yuda nea goonealshi aba bugusta buuneeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hawunda Yehoshafati",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobissa gheawalmeeda NG'UTAMIIDA jeeda gheambalmoojiga ng'eanyoojiga neaweesa Yuda, ak ea mudu gang'uchi saawa sea Yehoshafati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghapka fiisu ng'ay bea Filisti ak ghoadaw Yehoshafati gidageatinda, ea lapiyeeda gwaadi; ak eara fuga siguura Arabajeega gweasa niny lagweendi sagalamnyooji ispwa ea bughalaji ispwa ea ghwarayi sagalamnyooji ispwa ea bughalaji ispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Yehoshafati gwaheedu uurdaanyi. Ng'ata ghwadeas hilooga neaweesa Yuda, ea gealga heeda siitiiwshacheewa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gwandeawa gealga gheaseeniga aba jeeda mujiinajeega Yuda. Nea gaba shirikara, ea gheareemanga ng'ucheeda, aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih gida siyitiida gil aba gidabeada dooshinga ghweaniga nyaawa: fuga gheeh Yuda, shirikarajeega hees bea sagalamnyoojiga: Ea Adna was shirikarajeanda haw, bea fih sagalamnyooji bughalaji samwagu was fuga hees uurjeeni bea ng'ucheeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gabassa Yehohananeeda was shirikarajeanda haw, nea gwandeawa fih sagalamnyooji bughalaji iyeenya ea seedam ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gabassa niny Amasiyaheeda was orjeeda Sikri, gagadiiyeesa NG'UTAMIIDA, sea fih sagalamnyooji bughalaji iyeenya mideawa uurjeenga nea gaba ng'ucheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea gea gheeh Benjamini, Eliyada gil, was siida haw uur bea ng'ucheeda nea gaba fih sagalamnyooji bughalaji iyeenya mideawa ghuweanga ea igeambooniga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ng'ata gabassa niny Yehosabadi nea gaba fih sagalamnyooji ea bughalaji seedam, was fuga nisisin geat aba ng'ucheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean suh gea gadiyeeda sugoocheanda gil, ak aba badahuuka nyaawa ghwayiin sugoocheanda jeeda mujiinajeega sineaweesa hilooga aba jeeda ng'eanyiida sean bea Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
